<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian cenbank allots 6.21 bln ATS in repos.</title>
<headline>Austrian cenbank allots 6.21 bln ATS in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it alloted 6.21 billion schillings in two-week repurchase agreements at a fixed rate of three percent, filling five percent of bids.</p>
<p>Last week, the bank alloted 7.22 billion schillings, filling six percent of bids, also at a fixed three percent. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
